<li class=3D"ltx_item" id=3D"S1.I1.i3" style=3D"list-style-type:none;">
<span class=3D"ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span>
<div class=3D"ltx_para" id=3D"S1.I1.i3.p1">
<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"S1.I1.i3.p1.1">We propose a novel policy loss name=
d Advantage-Weighted Policy Optimization (AWPO) (see Section&nbsp;<a class=
=3D"ltx_ref" href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2405.11778v1#S4.SS3" title=3D"4=
.3 Advantage-Weighted Policy Optimization =E2=80=A3 4 MAZero algorithm =E2=
=80=A3 Efficient Multi-agent Reinforcement Learning by Planning"><span clas=
s=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>) utilizing the value information =
calculated by OS(<math alttext=3D"\lambda" class=3D"ltx_Math" display=3D"in=
line" id=3D"S1.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1"><semantics id=3D"S1.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1a"><mi i=
d=3D"S1.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref=3D"S1.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml">=CE=BB</mi><a=
