=3D"S1.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref=3D"S1.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1.1">=F0=9D=9C=86</=
ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex" id=3D"S1.I1.=
i3.p1.1.m1.1c">\lambda</annotation><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-ll=
amapun" id=3D"S1.I1.i3.p1.1.m1.1d">italic_=CE=BB</annotation></semantics></=
math>) to improve the sampled actions.</p><button class=3D"sr-only button" =
style=3D"display: none;">Report issue for preceding element</button>
</div>
</li>
<li class=3D"ltx_item" id=3D"S1.I1.i4" style=3D"list-style-type:none;">
<span class=3D"ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span>
<div class=3D"ltx_para ltx_noindent" id=3D"S1.I1.i4.p1">
<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"S1.I1.i4.p1.1">We conduct extensive experiments on=
 the SMAC benchmark, showing that MAZero achieves superior sample efficienc=
y compared to model-free approaches and provides better or comparable perfo=
rmance than existing model-based methods in terms of both sample and comput=
ation efficiency (see Section&nbsp;<a class=3D"ltx_ref" href=3D"https://arx=
iv.org/html/2405.11778v1#S5" title=3D"5 Experiments =E2=80=A3 Efficient Mul=
ti-agent Reinforcement Learning by Planning"><span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_re=
f_tag">5</span></a>).</p><button class=3D"sr-only button" style=3D"display:=
 none;">Report issue for preceding element</button>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
