<div class=3D"ltx_para ltx_noindent" id=3D"S3.SS2.p2">
<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"S3.SS2.p2.1">In practical applications like MARL, =
due to the significantly fewer samples taken compared to the original actio=
n space size, the underestimation issue of Sampled MCTS becomes more pronou=
nced, making it less than ideal in terms of searching efficiency.
This motivates us to design a more optimistic search process.</p><button cl=
ass=3D"sr-only button" style=3D"display: none;">Report issue for preceding =
element</button>
</div>
<div class=3D"ltx_para ltx_noindent" id=3D"S3.SS2.p3">
<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"S3.SS2.p3.3">Moreover, the behavior cloning (BC) l=
