<div class=3D"ltx_para ltx_noindent" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6">
<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.4">To offer a brief elucidation on this =
matter,
<a class=3D"ltx_ref" href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2405.11778v1#S4.E6" tit=
le=3D"In 4.2 Optimistic Search Lambda =E2=80=A3 4 MAZero algorithm =E2=80=
=A3 Efficient Multi-agent Reinforcement Learning by Planning"><span class=
=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span>&nbsp;<span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_=
ref_tag">6</span></a> is the set of optimistic values at depth <math alttex=
t=3D"d" class=3D"ltx_Math" display=3D"inline" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.1.m1.1"><sema=
ntics id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.1.m1.1a"><mi id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.1.m1.1.1" xref=3D"S4.SS2=
.p6.1.m1.1.1.cmml">d</mi><annotation-xml encoding=3D"MathML-Content" id=3D"=
S4.SS2.p6.1.m1.1b"><ci id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref=3D"S4.SS2.p6.1.m=
1.1.1">=F0=9D=91=91</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding=3D"applicatio=
n/x-tex" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.1.m1.1c">d</annotation><annotation encoding=3D"app=
lication/x-llamapun" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.1.m1.1d">italic_d</annotation></semant=
ics></math>, the degree of optimism is controlled by the quantile parameter=
 <math alttext=3D"\rho" class=3D"ltx_Math" display=3D"inline" id=3D"S4.SS2.=
p6.2.m2.1"><semantics id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.2.m2.1a"><mi id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.2.m2.1.1=
" xref=3D"S4.SS2.p6.2.m2.1.1.cmml">=CF=81</mi><annotation-xml encoding=3D"M=
athML-Content" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.2.m2.1b"><ci id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.2.m2.1.1.cmml" =
xref=3D"S4.SS2.p6.2.m2.1.1">=F0=9D=9C=8C</ci></annotation-xml><annotation e=
ncoding=3D"application/x-tex" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.2.m2.1c">\rho</annotation><an=
notation encoding=3D"application/x-llamapun" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.2.m2.1d">itali=
c_=CF=81</annotation></semantics></math>.
Since the model errors magnify with increasing depth in practice, <a class=
=3D"ltx_ref" href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2405.11778v1#S4.E7" title=3D"In=
 4.2 Optimistic Search Lambda =E2=80=A3 4 MAZero algorithm =E2=80=A3 Effici=
ent Multi-agent Reinforcement Learning by Planning"><span class=3D"ltx_text=
 ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span>&nbsp;<span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</=
span></a> calculates a weighted mean of all optimistic values in the subtre=
e as the value estimation of <math alttext=3D"s" class=3D"ltx_Math" display=
=3D"inline" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.3.m3.1"><semantics id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.3.m3.1a"><mi=
 id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.3.m3.1.1" xref=3D"S4.SS2.p6.3.m3.1.1.cmml">s</mi><annotati=
on-xml encoding=3D"MathML-Content" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.3.m3.1b"><ci id=3D"S4.SS=
2.p6.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref=3D"S4.SS2.p6.3.m3.1.1">=F0=9D=91=A0</ci></annotati=
on-xml><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.3.m3.1c">=
s</annotation><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-llamapun" id=3D"S4.SS2.=
p6.3.m3.1d">italic_s</annotation></semantics></math>, where the weight of d=
ifferent estimations are discounted by a factor <math alttext=3D"\lambda" c=
lass=3D"ltx_Math" display=3D"inline" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.4.m4.1"><semantics id=
=3D"S4.SS2.p6.4.m4.1a"><mi id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.4.m4.1.1" xref=3D"S4.SS2.p6.4.m4=
.1.1.cmml">=CE=BB</mi><annotation-xml encoding=3D"MathML-Content" id=3D"S4.=
SS2.p6.4.m4.1b"><ci id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.4.m4.1.1.cmml" xref=3D"S4.SS2.p6.4.m4.1=
.1">=F0=9D=9C=86</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding=3D"application/x=
-tex" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.4.m4.1c">\lambda</annotation><annotation encoding=3D"=
application/x-llamapun" id=3D"S4.SS2.p6.4.m4.1d">italic_=CE=BB</annotation>=
</semantics></math> over the depth.</p><button class=3D"sr-only button" sty=
le=3D"display: none;">Report issue for preceding element</button>
</div>
<div class=3D"ltx_para ltx_noindent" id=3D"S4.SS2.p7">
<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"S4.SS2.p7.1">Finally, we use the optimistic advant=
age (<a class=3D"ltx_ref" href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2405.11778v1#S4.E8=
" title=3D"In 4.2 Optimistic Search Lambda =E2=80=A3 4 MAZero algorithm =E2=
=80=A3 Efficient Multi-agent Reinforcement Learning by Planning"><span clas=
s=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span>&nbsp;<span class=3D"ltx_text ltx=
_ref_tag">8</span></a>) to replace the value score in <a class=3D"ltx_ref" =
href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2405.11778v1#S2.E3" title=3D"In Sampled MuZe=
ro =E2=80=A3 2 Background =E2=80=A3 Efficient Multi-agent Reinforcement Lea=
rning by Planning"><span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span>&nbs=
p;<span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> for optimistic search, =
that is:</p><button class=3D"sr-only button" style=3D"display: none;">Repor=
